# DWNLO's boot splash must actually hold during a NORMAL boot - no `splash` debug override here.
# main()'s single boot() call (host/x0x_host.c) already ran before this script's first line, so
# this exercises the real path: dwnlo_splash() set dwnlo_splash_hold_until, and ui_frame() (ui.c)
# must hold at that deadline (3600 ms, firmware/src/dwnlo_splash.c) before clearing to black and
# running ui_init(). Mid-hold: still up. Well past it: cleared, normal UI running.
wait 500
expect splash 1
shot dwnlo_boot_mid.png
wait 3600
expect splash 0
expect view 1
shot dwnlo_boot_post.png
